name innerscript
category Package
revision 57672
shortdesc Modifies automatic mathematics spacing
longdesc This package modifies two aspects of TeX's automatic interatom
longdesc mathematics spacing. It uses LuaTeX's \Umath primitives to make
longdesc superscripts and subscripts more closely resemble \textstyle
longdesc and \displaystyle math and to treat \mathinner subformulas as
longdesc \mathord, effectively eliminating this class.
